<title>HONG KONG: Cathay Pacific appoints Chen as director.</title>
<headline>Cathay Pacific appoints Chen as director.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cathay Pacific Airways Ltd said on Tuesday it has appointed Philip Chen as a director, effective March 1.</p>
<p>Chen begins his previously announced appointment as deputy managing director on March 15, the airline said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
